# ── Compose substitution vars (PUBLIC — no secrets belong in this file) ──

# Pin the image by DIGEST for immutability (not a moving tag). Get the digest:
#   docker buildx imagetools inspect mornedhels/enshrouded-server:dev-proton
# then paste the sha256 below. The audit workflow FAILS if this isn't a digest.
#
# Keen Games publishes no official server image, so this is a community one,
# like every other game here.
#
# The image's PROTON build, tag `dev-proton` (GE-Proton 11-9): a development
# build its maintainers published on 2026-10-15, the day Enshrouded 1.0 came
# out. Digest taken from Docker Hub on 2026-10-16. No numbered release runs 1.0
# under Proton yet - the Proton build of 1.7.2 dies at startup with "Failed to
# initialize Steamworks system...Version Mismatch / No SteamUtils011" - while
# this one starts cleanly (tested on this VM, 2026-10-16). Move to the first
# numbered release after 1.7.2 once it is out.
#
# Why not the Wine build this server started on: it ran, but with two players
# exploring it averaged 35-39 ms per world update and logged "Bad Performance"
# every 5 s - the in-game "high server load" warning - while the VM sat 77%
# idle. That Wine build does all thread synchronisation through one wineserver
# process; Proton does it in the kernel (fsync). Side by side on copies of the
# same world, idle: 4.3 ms -> 1.8 ms per update. See README.md, "The image".
#
# Rollback (it works, but lags with players on) is the 1.7.2-wine digest:
#   mornedhels/enshrouded-server@sha256:6bd473b78e5331a0fc86553d9e9ddef5c712d7e9b356af385aa90e772f931019
ENSHROUDED_IMAGE=mornedhels/enshrouded-server@sha256:d122801bb54498f41a6c0d8b27f336ec4c9266ffd5e4660611cb7c20c162318f

# Host paths & runtime identity. DATA_DIR holds gitignored runtime state:
#   data/game  -> /opt/enshrouded   the ~8 GB game install, the world
#                                   (server/savegame) and the live config
#                                   (server/enshrouded_server.json)
#
# 4711 is the image's own default and deliberately NOT an account on the VM
# (the other games run as ubuntu, uid 1000, which has sudo). If something ever
# broke out of this container it would land as a uid that owns nothing here.
DATA_DIR=./data
PUID=4711
PGID=4711
TZ=UTC

# Enshrouded's ONE port. Since Content Update 2 there is no separate game port:
# play, Steam query and the server browser all use the query port.
GAME_PORT=15637
